# Stale Tab focus after loading a game (original 2005 bug, fixed in recomp/lift.py):
# loading from the Kapitelauswahl screen left the GUI focus root on the closed screen, so
# Tab cycled its invisible slots/buttons in the room and Tab + Space/Enter in the same
# input batch "activated" a slot -> crash at 0x0041185d. New game -> l/001 -> quick save
# -> quick load -> Tab together with Space/Enter must not crash and must stay in l/001.
wait video 60
1000 tap Escape
wait menu 60
1500 click 60 553
wait room x/006 30
1500 click 114 566
+2000 tap Escape
wait room l/001 30
2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
